{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "独自留守后期机房  (Staying Alone in the Editing Suite)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "crew": "场务",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Late at night in Xingtian's post-production suite, the editing crew wraps up a month of rush work so the travel show can be delivered to DTS tomorrow. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "魅力远航赶工一个月，手续都齐了，明天成片签字就能交给电视台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "总算是赶上了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们辛苦了，既然做完了就先回去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "那淳于总您不走吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我再过一下成片，不用等我，你们先回去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "淳于总一向有这个习惯，那咱们就先走吧，再见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家路上注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且失踪人士不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道，现在两条路都是死路。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起商业利益，政治风险会让我们输得更彻底。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "魅力远航赶工一个月，手续都齐了，明天成片签字就能交给电视台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After a month of rush work on the travel show, all paperwork is complete and the master cut goes to the station tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "总算是赶上了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We finally made the deadline in time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们辛苦了，既然做完了就先回去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you all for your hard work; now that it is finished, head home and get some rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "那淳于总您不走吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you not leaving too, Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我再过一下成片，不用等我，你们先回去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will review the master cut once more; do not wait up for me—go on home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "淳于总一向有这个习惯，那咱们就先走吧，再见！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao always has that habit, so let us head out first—goodbye!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家路上注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone stay safe on the way home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Officials have just confirmed the missing-persons list.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且失踪人士不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Moreover, officials cannot rule out the possibility that missing persons were kidnapped.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道，现在两条路都是死路。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know—right now both paths lead to a dead end.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起商业利益，政治风险会让我们输得更彻底。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Compared with commercial losses, political risk could ruin everyone far more completely.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "魅力远航赶工一个月，手续都齐了，明天成片签字就能交给电视台。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "总算是赶上了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们辛苦了，既然做完了就先回去休息吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "那淳于总您不走吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我再过一下成片，不用等我，你们先回去。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "淳于总一向有这个习惯，那咱们就先走吧，再见！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "大家路上注意安全。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "官方刚刚确认了失踪者名单。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且失踪人士不排除被劫持绑架的可能性。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我知道，现在两条路都是死路。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "比起商业利益，政治风险会让我们输得更彻底。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Haunted by the risk that airing the footage could endanger a kidnap victim abroad, Chun Yuqiao stays behind alone to make an agonising choice. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "明天见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
